  "analysis": {
    "summary": "Over {{chord 1}} the line leaps down through the chord in wide intervals, then a half-step approach pushes up into the 3rd of {{chord 2}}. Bar 2 climbs a diminished-7th arpeggio from that 3rd (3rd, 5th, 7th, b9) and comes back down, and the b9 at the end of the bar falls a half step to the 5th of {{chord 3}} on beat 1.",
