        "text": "Until its last note, bar 1 uses only the four notes of {{chord 1}} (root, b3, b5 and b7) in a zigzag: three downward leaps (root to b5, 7th to b3, b5 to 7th) with a rising 3rd between them. Bar 2 starts on the 3rd of {{chord 2}} ({{note 2.1}}) and stacks its 5th and 7th on top."
      },
      {
