        ],
        "text": "The b9 is the sound of the V chord in a minor key. Starting the arpeggio on the 3rd turns it into a diminished-7th shape with the b9 on top: the line passes it on the way up ({{note 2.4}}) and ends the bar on it ({{note 2.8}})."
      },
