        ],
        "text": "{{note 1.8}} sits a half step below the 3rd of {{chord 2}}, right after the 7th of {{chord 1}} a half step above it, so the two notes squeeze the 3rd from both sides. Played on the 'and' of 4, it pushes into the new chord so the 3rd arrives right on beat 1."
